OL,3,GNEWSATeens wow supermodel with upcycled
OL,4,Aoutfits
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeenagers who transformed unwanted
OL,7,Fclothes into catwalk-ready fashion have
OL,8,Fwon praise from supermodel Erin
OL,9,FO'Connor after showcasing their
OL,10,Fcreations at a Wolverhampton fashion
OL,11,Fshow.
OL,13,FMore than 100 students presented
OL,14,Foriginal designs made from donated and
OL,15,Fpre-loved garments at the event at
OL,16,FWolverhampton's Mander Centre.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
