OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSATeens wow supermodel with upcycled
OL,4,Aoutfits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe winning outfit, created by
OL,7,FSebastian and Railijs, both 13, and
OL,8,FLucian, 14, featured a grey blazer
OL,9,Fdecorated with colourful upcycled
OL,10,Fmaterials including plastic bottle
OL,11,Fcaps, fabric scraps, ribbons and
OL,12,Fpatterned textiles.
OL,14,FThe teenagers spent a month
OL,15,Ftransforming discarded clothing through
OL,16,Fsewing, repair and redesign before
OL,17,Ftaking to the runway to present their
OL,18,Fcreations.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
